                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This dataset concerns habitation of houses in the inner city of Leiden in the period 1890-1899 and 1930-1940. Focal point of the research was the relation between macro-economic developments in the Netherlands and demographic behaviour in Leiden. The data was collected during a seminar on Social History in 1976 and 1977, Leiden University.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
